# TextFSM template for `show ntp associations` on Cisco Catalyst 2950 EI.
# The leading flag characters (e.g. "*~") are attached to the peer address.
# Verified: IOS 12.1(22)EA9, WS-C2950G-48-EI.
Value SYNCFLAG ([*#+~o-]*)
Value REMOTE (\S+)
Value REFID (\S+)
Value STRATUM (\d+)
Value WHEN (\S+)
Value POLL (\d+)
Value REACH (\d+)
Value DELAY (\S+)
Value OFFSET (\S+)
Value DISP (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*${SYNCFLAG}${REMOTE}\s+${REFID}\s+${STRATUM}\s+${WHEN}\s+${POLL}\s+${REACH}\s+${DELAY}\s+${OFFSET}\s+${DISP}\s*$$ -> Record
